{"id":"neben","lemma":"neben","pos":"prep","rank":749,"glosses":["next to, beside, alongside, adjacent to, near, near to","in addition to, besides, alongside, apart from, aside from, among, amongst, on top of","compared with"],"ipa":"/ˈneːbən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/aa/De-neben.ogg/De-neben.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Du kannst dich neben mich setzen.","en":"You can sit next to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760265","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to sit down"}]},{"text":"Alle wollen neben ihr sitzen.","en":"Everybody wants to sit beside her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745043","words":[{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"to want"},null,{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"to sit"}]},{"text":"Darf ich neben dir sitzen?","en":"May I sit next to you?","words":[{"g":"to be allowed","l":"dürfen"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to sit"}]},{"text":"Mein Onkel wohnt neben der Schule.","en":"My uncle lives near the school.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593083","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"uncle"},{"g":"to live, reside, dwell","l":"wohnen"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"school"}]},{"text":"Niemand wollte neben mir sitzen.","en":"No one wanted to sit next to me.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to sit"}]}]}